RK\nDescription:A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of language models on various natural language understanding tasks. ; A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of natural language processing models, including BERT, XLNet, RoBERTa, and SpanBERT.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=71, avg_entity_tokens=38, max_entities=144, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[71]
